// Vale return — Map 8's shortcut back to the Lost Vale, once it is open
//
// WHY. Teleport 212 (Map 8 -> Map 10's pad 212) is the RETURN route: the
// way back to the Vale for a player who came out by Map 10's trigger 213.
// As an engine TeleportEgg it fired for anyone, and TeleportEgg::hatch is
// unconditional. Its slab lies in the doors chamber's bone field, on the
// first-visit way in from the spitter corridor, so a player who drifted
// east on the way to the double doors landed in the Vale with steps 3
// (the key, the doors, Map 9) and 4 (Map 11's talismans and pillars) never
// done (docs/playtest-2026-10-11-replay-leg2.md finding 1; repro save
// replay1011-s02d-m8-pocket-t212-repro.sav, a mouse run E 3.54 s, N 2.5 s).
//
// GATE. allColumnsDestroyed, set by the last pillar's receptacle
// (COLPUZZL.UNK). It is what unseals Map 11's way to trigger 205, the only
// way into the Vale, so it holds for every player who has reached the
// Vale, and for no one who has not. Unset, the hatch does nothing; there
// is no 1994 line for "not yet", and no new text is written for one.
// Egg::hatch latches _hatched until the egg leaves the fast area
// (egg.cpp:40-63), but the flag can only be set on Map 11, and the switch
// back re-reads this fixed record, so a first-visit no-op never blocks the
// later return.
//
// HOW. teleportToEgg, retail's own usecode teleport (MainActor::
// I_teleportToEgg, intrinsic 0xCC): map first, then the arrival pad's id,
// then retail's stasis byte, as CARTHAXH (retail class 0x487) calls it.
// It moves the Avatar exactly as TeleportEgg::hatch did (MainActor::
// teleport(map, id)), onto Map 10's pad 212.
//
// WHERE. build_map_08.py, on the pale slab in the bone field, in place of
// the engine teleporter: the same npcnum 0x11, so the same hatch box.
//
// DISPATCH: UnkEgg quality, class = quality + 0x47F (manifest-pinned).

uses "egg";

globalflag allColumnsDestroyed;

eggclass EggValeReturn inherits Egg
{
	process hatch();
}

process EggValeReturn::hatch()
{
	if allColumnsDestroyed
	{
		teleportToEgg(MapLostVale, 212, 1);
	}
}
